  "body": [
    "Fei‑Fei Li",
    "We design and engineer scalable, AI-ready data platforms that integrate, process and deliver trusted data across hybrid and real-time environments.",
    "We transform data into reusable, business-aligned products that enable consistent access, interoperability and value generation across the enterprise.",
    "We establish trusted data foundations through end-to-end governance, quality and security frameworks that ensure reliable and responsible data usage.",
    "A cloud-native, scalable, and data-driven platform designed to simplify data access and enable AI adoption.",
    "Laife Reply collaborates with IEO to innovate diagnosis-therapeutic paths through personalised medicine, combining AI and Big Data in the Value Based Medicine platform.",
    "Target Reply has partnered with Agos to create a virtual assistant that simplifies interaction with data and supports the transformation of the Data Warehouse.",
    "Aston Martin Lagonda (AML), a British manufacturer of ultra-luxury high-performance sports cars and sports utility vehicles (SUVs), increased customer engagement, provided dealer partners with better customer insights, and improved predictions by 85 percent using a propensity-to-buy model powered by artificial intelligence (AI) on Amazon Web Services (AWS).",
    "Discover the Potential of Synthetic Data in Supporting the Deployment of Specialised AI Models Across Various Industries and Business Departments",
    "Discover also"
